What's New

AndroLua+ Code Editor - Version 1.1 Summary

Run Code Integration: Execute your Lua scripts directly from the editor. Includes automated Syntax and Runtime Error handling that displays detailed error messages instead of crashing.

New File Creator: Generate fresh files with custom names and extensions. The app automatically parses pasted code into an editable, line-by-line structure.

Advanced Function Block Editor:

Auto-Format: One-tap intelligent alignment and indentation for professional code readability.

Undo/Redo: Full change-history tracking for edits made within function blocks.

Smart Paste: Automatically splits pasted code into lines and applies formatting.

Clear with Confirmation: A safety prompt added to the 'Clear' function to prevent accidental data loss.

Copy All Lines: Export entire function blocks to the clipboard with a single tap.

Advanced File History Management:

Edit File: New options in the history menu to either 'Replace Code' (overwrite existing files with new content) or 'Rename' files.

Optimized Navigation: Fixed the execution flow, ensuring that users return instantly to the editor interface after running scripts.

